name: sim.getObjectName
description: 
luaSynopsis: string objectName=sim.getObjectName(int objectHandle)
inputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. objectHandle: handle of the object. By adding sim.handleflag_altname to the object handle, the object alternative name can be retrieved.
outputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. Name (or alternative name) of the object if operation was successful, nullptr otherwise. The user is in charge of destroying the returned buffer with simReleaseBuffer
